        "title": "Two women (one in front is Sangha-Sangha) sat on a raised wooden log platform underneath a shelter with open sides. Another person sits just behind. Two full sacks lie on the platform and the woman on the left appears to be fixing her skirt. The framework of the shelter is arc-shaped and covered with large leaves to form a roof. A large upright basket is leaning against the outside of the shelter. In the background more dome-shaped shelters are visible. The image is similar to 1997.21.3.253 although this image is lighter.",
